<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="pickup.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="pickup">
    <!-- §8.1 gate-blocker backlog: the item PICKUP menu (pickup.cpp
         pick_up_from_items). A multi-select list (hotkey char + parent/pick
         mark + item name, with the selected row highlighted) over a scrolling
         item-info pane, plus a header (predicted weight/volume) and a footer
         hint line. Render-only: all marking / count entry / filter / paging stay
         on the keyboard + the Tier-0 string_input filter popup; the doc is synced
         each frame from getitem[]/matches/selected. The curses start/maxitems
         windowing is dropped for native scroll (selected row scrolled into view
         on move). Per-row/segment colour is baked via cata_text_to_rml. -->
    <div class="panel pu-panel">
        <div class="pu-header" data-rml="header_rml"></div>
        <div id="pu-list" class="pu-list scroll-pane">
            <div class="pu-row" data-for="r : rows" data-class-selected="r.selected">
                <span class="pu-key" data-rml="r.hotkey_rml"></span>
                <span class="pu-mark" data-rml="r.mark_rml"></span>
                <span class="pu-name" data-rml="r.name_rml"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pu-info-title" data-rml="info_title_rml"></div>
        <div id="pu-info" class="pu-info scroll-pane" data-rml="info_body_rml"></div>
        <div class="pu-footer" data-rml="footer_rml"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
